<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A5.T1.6.1.6.4.1.1.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">2) Effective compression strength in range 0.2-0.3 </span>
<br class="ltx_break"></span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T1.6.1.7" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T1.6.1.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t" style="padding-left:3.0pt;padding-right:3.0pt;">
