<td id="A5.T3.6.1.3.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">7.81x higher feature utilisation</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T3.6.1.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A5.T3.6.1.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Multi-timescale states</td>
