<td id="A5.T3.6.1.4.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">12.4</td>
<td id="A5.T3.6.1.4.5" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">-18.4% better long-range modeling</td></tr>
<tr id="A5.T3.6.1.5" class="ltx_tr">
